{"id":"2181627905","type":"page","ari":"ari:cloud:confluence:97c827fd-41ee-460c-8f51-353e72947a5e:page/2181627905","base64EncodedAri":"YXJpOmNsb3VkOmNvbmZsdWVuY2U6OTdjODI3ZmQtNDFlZS00NjBjLThmNTEtMzUzZTcyOTQ3YTVlOmNvbnRlbnQvMjE4MTYyNzkwNQ==","status":"current","title":"Upload Ships Data (API)","version":{"by":{"type":"known","accountId":"712020:0c75c33d-f7ab-4eeb-b37e-68b2ac9ee021","accountType":"atlassian","email":"","publicName":"Yasar Mahomed Abbas (Unlicensed)","profilePicture":{"path":"/wiki/aa-avatar/712020:0c75c33d-f7ab-4eeb-b37e-68b2ac9ee021","width":48,"height":48,"isDefault":false},"displayName":"Yasar Mahomed Abbas (Unlicensed)","isExternalCollaborator":false,"isGuest":false,"locale":"en_US","accountStatus":"active","_expandable":{"operations":"","personalSpace":""},"_links":{"self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/user?accountId=712020:0c75c33d-f7ab-4eeb-b37e-68b2ac9ee021"}},"when":"2024-08-26T07:41:16.164Z","friendlyWhen":"Aug 26, 2024","message":"","number":1,"minorEdit":false,"ncsStepVersion":"1","ncsStepVersionSource":"ncs-ack","confRev":"confluence$content$2181627905.26","contentTypeModified":false,"_expandable":{"collaborators":"","content":"/rest/api/content/2181627905"},"_links":{"self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2181627905/version/1"}},"macroRenderedOutput":{},"body":{"storage":{"value":"<h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Description</span></h2><p>Uploads a CSV file to the cruise application and processes the document based on the provided <code>{voyage_id}</code>.</p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Authentication</span></h2><p>The API requires you to provide an API key in your requests to get responses. The key should be included in the header of your request:</p><p><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;--header 'x-api-key: &lt;your_api_key_here&gt; ' </em></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">HTTP Request Format</span></h2><p>POST <code>https://{mfp.url}/API/v1/CruiseApplication/{voyage_id}/uploadShipsData</code></p><table data-table-width=\"736\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"0ef6d450-83b9-4db9-aa3a-7d62228a6691\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 115.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 621.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Parameter</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Description</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>mfp.url</p></td><td><p>The MFP url for your organisation</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>voyage_id</p></td><td><p>The identification number of the voyage</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Request Body</span></h2><p>The request body must be a <code>multipart/form-data</code> and include the following key-value pair:</p><ul><li><p><code>csvFile</code> (required):  <br />  The CSV file to be uploaded.</p><p>  <strong>Example</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Key: <code>csvFile</code></p></li><li><p>Value: The actual CSV file to be uploaded.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Errors</span></h2><p>MFP APIs follow the HTTP response status codes, which indicate whether a specific HTTP request has been successfully completed. Below a summary of the most common codes you'll find in our responses:</p><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"bc21dd33-ab29-4ba5-9019-b65a812cbc1e\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 148.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 610.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Code</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Description</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>200</p></td><td><p>OK. Everything worked as expected.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>400</p></td><td><p>Bad Request. The request was unacceptable, often due to missing a required parameter.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>401</p></td><td><p>Unauthorized. No valid API key provided.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>403</p></td><td><p>Forbidden. The API key doesn't have permissions to perform the request.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>404</p></td><td><p>Not Found. The requested resource doesn't exist.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>429</p></td><td><p>Too Many Requests. Too many requests hit the API too quickly. We recommend an exponential backoff of your requests.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>500, 502, 503, 504</p></td><td><p>Server Errors. Something went wrong on MFP end.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Response</span></h2><p><code>200 OK</code>: The CSV file was successfully uploaded and processed.</p><p />","representation":"storage","embeddedContent":[],"_expandable":{"content":"/rest/api/content/2181627905"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","atlas_doc_format":"","view":"","export_view":"","styled_view":"","markdown":"","dynamic":"","editor2":"","anonymous_export_view":""}},"extensions":{"position":483645144},"_expandable":{"container":"/rest/api/space/API","metadata":"","restrictions":"/rest/api/content/2181627905/restriction/byOperation","history":"/rest/api/content/2181627905/history","descendants":"/rest/api/content/2181627905/descendant","space":"/rest/api/space/API","childTypes":"","schedulePublishInfo":"","operations":"","schedulePublishDate":"","children":"/rest/api/content/2181627905/child","ancestors":"","draftVersion":""},"_links":{"editui":"/pages/resumedraft.action?draftId=2181627905","webui":"/spaces/API/pages/2181627905/Upload+Ships+Data+API","edituiv2":"/spaces/API/pages/edit-v2/2181627905","context":"/wiki","self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2181627905","tinyui":"/x/AQAJgg","collection":"/rest/api/content","base":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki"}}